<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.4.11">
<l>vēyartaṅkaḷ kulattutitta viṭṭucit taṉmaṉattē</l>
<l>kōyilkoṇṭa kōvalaṉaik koḻuṅkuḷir mukilvaṇṇaṉai</l>
<l>āyarēṟṟai yamararkōvai yantaṇarta mamutattiṉai</l>
<l>cāyaipōlap pāṭavallār tāmuma ṇukkarkaḷē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Those who are able to sing about Gopala</l>
<l rend="indent">who took [as his] temple the heart of Viṭṭucittaṉ</l>
<l rend="indent">who was born into the clan of Vēyars,</l>
<l>he with the complexion of a plump, cool cloud,</l>
<l>the bull among herders, the king of the celestials,</l>
<l rend="indent">the nectar of brahmins,</l>
<l>they will be as near [to Him] as a shadow.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
